---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="MingHsuan Lee — senior data scientist and ML engineer based in Auckland, New Zealand.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-24">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-4">
      <h1
        class="font-serif text-ink"
        style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 44;"
      >
        About
      </h1>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted text-xs font-mono tracking-wider uppercase mb-16">
      MingHsuan Lee &nbsp;·&nbsp; Auckland, New Zealand
    </p>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <h2>What I do day-to-day</h2>
      <p>
        I'm a senior data scientist and ML engineer at a fintech lender in Auckland — building production data and AI systems for risk decisioning and credit infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I build and ship AI agents for my own use and for small commercial experiments. I write about what I learn doing both.
      </p>

      <h2>What I write about here</h2>
      <p>
        AI agent infrastructure — MCP, context engineering, retrieval, and orchestration at production scale.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal is to share what I've learned shipping multiple production AI agents on small, self-hosted infrastructure — the trade-offs, the decisions, the mistakes worth avoiding. <em>Production-grounded, not theoretical.</em>
      </p>

      <h2>Background, briefly</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>12 years in data science and ML across banking, fintech, and NZ Police.</li>
        <li>MAS in Spatial Analysis for Public Health, Johns Hopkins.</li>
        <li>Based in Auckland since 2014.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/writing" class="btn-primary no-underline">Read latest writing →</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary no-underline">Contact / Subscribe</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/MingHsuanLee" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary no-underline">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/minghsuanlee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary no-underline">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
